# ===========================================================================
#  李瑞文 KF LAW99 —— 可视化用引擎 deck
#
#  内容来源: examples/userlib/kf_law99/test/kf_law99_0001.rad 的副本。
#  模型、材料、载荷、时间步设定**全部保持不变**; 只做了下面标注的后处理输出改动,
#  目的是让这次计算的结果能在 HyperView 里打开:
#
#    [ADDED]   /ANIM/VECT/DIS        输出节点位移矢量
#    [ADDED]   /H3D/...              输出 H3D(含 KF 状态变量 User Var)
#    [CHANGED] /ANIM/DT 的 TFREQ     0.001 -> 0.0002 (原来只出 2 帧, 看不了动画)
#
#  注: 本机 HyperWorks 14 读不了 H3D(格式版本太新, 见 README),
#      但它能读 /ANIM 产出的 A001 动画文件; H3D 留给更新版 HyperWorks。
# ===========================================================================
/ANIM/DT
#   TSTART     TFREQ
0.0 0.0002
# [ADDED] displacement vectors for HyperView
/ANIM/VECT/DIS
/DT
0.500000 0.000000
/MON/ON
/PARITH/ON
/PRINT/-10/55
/RUN/LAW99_KF/1
0.002
/TFILE/4
#            dT_HIS
0.0005
# [ADDED] H3D output. USER/UVAR=n writes KF state variable n:
#   1=D damage, 2=alpha, 3=epbar, 4=P pressure, 5=sigma_y,
#   6=epsdot_eq, 7=J, 8=mu   (see KF_LAW99_Guide.md section 4)
/H3D/DT
#   TSTART     TFREQ
0.0 0.0002
/H3D/SOLID/EPSP
/H3D/SOLID/VONM
/H3D/SOLID/DENS
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=1
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=2
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=3
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=4
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=5
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=7
1
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=8
1
/VERS/2019
